Package: hfs
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Essential: yes
Priority: required
Depends: corefoundation, iokit, libsystem, libutil
Description: HFS+ tools (mount_hfs, newfs_hfs, fsck_hfs)
 Tools to mount, create, check and repair HFS+ filesystems.
 The filesystem kernel extension is built with the kernel.

Package: hfs-dev
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: hfs (= ${binary:Version})
Description: HFS+ filesystem development headers
 Public HFS+ format, mount and Unicode headers for building userland tools.
